  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="89843df3-6fc9-5817-b2bd-73ff2c638713" activityNameId="b44d2a70-f46d-576e-81be-91bb5c4dd4f6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tied housing system, cattle, operation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tied housing system, cattle, operation
The module includes the use of energy and auxiliary materials for the operation of lighting, storage and drying of roughage, slurry agitator, milking machine, milk cooling, cleaning, drinking water. The functional unit is 1 livestock unit (LU) during 1 year.;
UUID: 936a891c-39d0-3a44-83f7-de215d4c30c4
The inventory takes into account the energy and auxiliary materials like water, lubricating oil and cleaning agents for the use of the described module for one year. Also included is the use of the infrastructure with the binding of a certain part of the appropriate infrastructure module. Not taken into account were the direct emission of the animal husbandry, fodder production and produced waste water.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The use of energy and auxiliary materials are calculated for the conditions defined in the infrastructure-module with literature data and experts knowledge.
Time period: Period indicated in the reference. 
Production volume: Existing tied housing system for cattle in Switzerland in 1996: 47984 units.
Sampling: In the use of energy and auxiliary materials are big differences between the farms. The inventory is based on mean values from CH and WEU. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_936a891c-39d0-3a44-83f7-de215d4c30c4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
